"| `app_id` | Platform |\n"
"| -------- | -------- |\n"
"| `pair-programming` | `studio-pair-programming` |\n"
"| `parlor` | `parlor` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| `app_id` | 平台 |\n"
"| -------- | -------- |\n"
"| `pair-programming` | `studio-pair-programming` |\n"
"| `parlor` | `parlor` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
